msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:207
msgid "Independent Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:209
msgid "Audience and conversion tracking: visits, views, bounce rate, WooCommerce conversion rate, net sales, top pages, acquisition channels, UTM campaigns, and device breakdowns."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:212
#: includes/class-permissions.php:68
#: includes/class-permissions.php:467
msgid "Custom Fields & Meta (ACF & Code)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:214
msgid "Unified catalog of custom fields defined in code (register_post_meta) and ACF (groups, recursive subfields, location rules, options pages). Includes single post/product metadata inspection with resolved values."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:217
msgid "WooCommerce Store Data"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:219
msgid "Store health summary, paginated product catalog with variations and unified SEO, recent orders with strict GDPR/PII anonymization, native sales performance reports (net/gross sales, AOV, % growth), top performing products and coupons, stock financial valuation & dormant stock alerts, and webhook delivery health."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:222
#: includes/class-permissions.php:78
#: includes/class-permissions.php:572
msgid "Pages, Content & SEO"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:224
msgid "WordPress pages and blog posts hierarchy, raw and rendered Gutenberg block trees, detected shortcodes, page templates, and unified SEO audit across pages, posts, WooCommerce products, and categories (Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress, AIOSEO)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:227
msgid "Site Performance & Profiling"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:229
msgid "Auto-discovery of 5 template archetypes (home, shop, category, product, cart), on-demand URL profiler (SQL queries and execution time attributed per plugin, memory, TTFB, duplicate/slow queries), 100% native Core Web Vitals & frontend signals (DOM size & Elementor %, CLS missing image dimensions, legacy formats, Google Fonts swap, WP core bloat scripts, cart fragments), autoload bloat, and plugins database footprint."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:240
msgid "Dynamic Procedural Playbooks & AI Skill Generator"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:243
msgid "WP Agent Bridge is more than raw endpoints: it embeds 7 structured MECE Master Playbooks and dynamically generates ready-to-use AI skills."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:250
msgid "Self-Updating Skill (?format=skill)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:253
msgid "When an AI agent queries /capabilities?format=skill, the plugin generates an up-to-date SKILL.md file with active routes and playbooks. When you update the plugin, the AI detects new capabilities without re-copying prompts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:260
msgid "7 MECE Master Audit Playbooks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:263
msgid "Organized into 7 Strategic MECE Master Pillars: 360° SEO & Content, Agency Performance & Core Web Vitals, System Health & Database Bloat Hygiene, Orders & Checkout Troubleshooting, 360° E-Commerce Sales & Analytics, Shipping Logistics & Flexible Shipping, and Code Architecture & Automations Map."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:270
msgid "Permission-Adaptive Workflows"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:273
msgid "Playbooks dynamically adapt to your site settings. If you disable a module in the Permissions tab, associated playbook steps are automatically pruned so the AI never triggers 403 Forbidden errors."
